5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical way to handle the shortage. I want to see the actual usage and the physical state of the area.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree we need data. I'm interested in the financial side and what the alternatives outside the building cost.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,It feels like some people have had the best spots for too long. I'll look into the history and current usage.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not turn this into a war. I want to know how these disputes usually play out in similar settings.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I just want to make sure whoever manages this doesn't get overwhelmed! I'll check the paperwork and the equipment.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, that's a fair point. I'll stick to the physical layout and the morning rush.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, sounds good. I'll focus on the ledger and the ward park.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I'll check the minutes and the sticker register to see who is actually using the spaces.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll look at the neighboring block's experience and the complaint logs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm going with the treasurer's file and the supplier's display frame!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
